---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Optional Divine Name overlay" description="A private, optional STAM-outline overlay for ajew.org, with independent colors, placement, opacity and gentle effects.">
  <div class="name-overlay-page">
    <header class="no-intro">
      <p class="no-eyebrow">An optional aid · off by default</p>
      <h1>Divine Name overlay</h1>
      <p>Choose an unobtrusive visual reminder while reading on ajew.org. The Name uses exact STAM outlines, with a much smaller, source-exact pointed outline footer below it; your reading stays unchanged and clicks pass through the artwork.</p>
      <p>This <strong>website overlay stays inside ajew.org in your browser</strong>. It cannot appear over other apps. For that, use the separate Windows download below.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="no-workspace">
      <form class="no-panel" id="name-overlay-settings" data-name-overlay-panel>
        <h2>Website settings</h2>
        <noscript><p>JavaScript is required for the optional website overlay. It is currently off.</p></noscript>
        <label class="no-check"><input type="checkbox" data-no-field="enabled" /><span>Enable the website overlay</span></label>
        <label class="no-check"><input type="checkbox" data-no-field="remember" checked /><span>Keep my choice across ajew.org pages on this browser</span></label>
        <p class="no-hint">The overlay starts off. Once you enable it, your choice and settings automatically follow you across ajew.org pages and reloads. Uncheck this box for this page only. Hide saves the off state when remembering is enabled.</p>
        <div class="no-actions"><button type="button" data-no-action="hide">Hide / disable now</button><button type="button" data-no-action="clear">Clear saved settings</button></div>
        <p class="no-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-no-status>Overlay off. Enable it to keep your choice across ajew.org pages.</p>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Letter arrangement</legend>
          <label for="no-method">Visualization method</label>
          <select id="no-method" data-no-field="method"><option value="interleaved">Interleaved — alternating primary and secondary letters</option><option value="nested">Nested — secondary Name inside the final, leftmost primary letter</option></select>
          <div class="no-range-row"><div><label for="no-secondary-size-range">Secondary letter size</label><input id="no-secondary-size-range" type="range" min="10" max="50" step="1" value="25" data-no-field="secondarySize" aria-describedby="no-secondary-size-hint" /></div><div><label for="no-secondary-size-number">Size %</label><input id="no-secondary-size-number" type="number" min="10" max="50" step="1" value="25" data-no-field="secondarySize" aria-describedby="no-secondary-size-hint" /></div></div>
          <p id="no-secondary-size-hint" class="no-hint">Percentage of primary ink height, independent of overall screen size. Interleaved secondary letters stay centered in their original slots. The nested group is centered and capped at its original inset size (about 14% of primary ink height), so larger values cannot enlarge it beyond the final letter’s inset.</p>
          <div data-no-preview aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="no-hint">Exact footer below the Name: <bdi class="no-footer-source" dir="rtl" lang="he">נַ נַחְ נַחְמָ נַחְמָן מאומן</bdi>. The final word remains unpointed, exactly as supplied. The footer’s complete height, including vowel marks, is only 25% of the primary Name’s ink height in both arrangements.</p>
          <p class="no-hint">The still preview shows your chosen colors, size, effect and intensity; motion appears only on the live overlay. The two arrangements are user-specified visualization methods, not a quotation from the passage below.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Independent colors</legend>
          <div class="no-color-row"><div><label for="no-primary-picker">Primary</label><input id="no-primary-picker" type="color" value="#87CEEB" data-no-field="primary" /></div><div><label for="no-primary-hex">Primary hex</label><input id="no-primary-hex" type="text" value="#87CEEB" data-no-field="primary" pattern="#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}" maxlength="7" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="no-color-hint" /></div></div>
          <div class="no-color-row"><div><label for="no-secondary-picker">Secondary</label><input id="no-secondary-picker" type="color" value="#000000" data-no-field="secondary" /></div><div><label for="no-secondary-hex">Secondary hex</label><input id="no-secondary-hex" type="text" value="#000000" data-no-field="secondary" pattern="#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}" maxlength="7" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="no-color-hint" /></div></div>
          <div class="no-color-row"><div><label for="no-footer-picker">Footer</label><input id="no-footer-picker" type="color" value="#000000" data-no-field="footer" /></div><div><label for="no-footer-hex">Footer hex</label><input id="no-footer-hex" type="text" value="#000000" data-no-field="footer" pattern="#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}" maxlength="7" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="no-color-hint" /></div></div>
          <p id="no-color-hint" class="no-hint">Use a six-digit hex color. Effects apply only to primary letters; secondary letters and the footer keep their own independent colors. Presets change only the two Name colors.</p>
          <div class="no-presets" aria-label="Color presets"><button type="button" data-no-preset="sky">Sky + black</button><button type="button" data-no-preset="ink">Ink + black</button><button type="button" data-no-preset="pearl">Pearl + sky</button><button type="button" data-no-preset="gold">Gold + ink</button></div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Opacity</legend>
          <div class="no-range-row"><div><label for="no-opacity-range">Opacity slider</label><input id="no-opacity-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="55" data-no-field="opacity" /></div><div><label for="no-opacity-number">Opacity %</label><input id="no-opacity-number" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="55" data-no-field="opacity" /></div></div>
          <p class="no-hint">0% is fully transparent; 100% is fully opaque. Hide remains available at either setting.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Screen size &amp; placement</legend>
          <div class="no-two"><div><label for="no-width">Maximum width %</label><input id="no-width" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="48" data-no-field="width" /></div><div><label for="no-height">Maximum height %</label><input id="no-height" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="24" data-no-field="height" /></div></div>
          <p class="no-hint">Percentages of the browser viewport. The complete artwork fits inside both limits, with its proportions preserved — never stretched or cropped.</p>
          <label for="no-anchor">Anchor</label><select id="no-anchor" data-no-field="anchor"><option value="top-left">Top left</option><option value="top">Top center</option><option value="top-right">Top right</option><option value="left">Middle left</option><option value="center" selected>Center</option><option value="right">Middle right</option><option value="bottom-left">Bottom left</option><option value="bottom">Bottom center</option><option value="bottom-right">Bottom right</option><option value="custom">Custom X / Y</option></select>
          <div class="no-two"><div><label for="no-x">Horizontal X %</label><input id="no-x" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="50" data-no-field="x" /></div><div><label for="no-y">Vertical Y %</label><input id="no-y" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="50" data-no-field="y" /></div></div>
          <p class="no-hint">X / Y moves the fitted artwork through the available space: 0% aligns its left / top edge; 100% aligns its right / bottom edge. Editing either selects Custom.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Optional effects</legend>
          <label for="no-effect">Primary-letter effect</label><select id="no-effect" data-no-field="effect"><option value="none">None — plain outlines</option><option value="fire">Fire — golden-orange moving fill</option><option value="glow">Glow — warm, steady halo</option><option value="shimmer">Shimmer — bright luminous bands</option></select>
          <div class="no-range-row"><div><label for="no-intensity-range">Effect intensity</label><input id="no-intensity-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="40" data-no-field="intensity" /></div><div><label for="no-intensity-number">Intensity %</label><input id="no-intensity-number" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="40" data-no-field="intensity" /></div></div>
          <p class="no-hint">0% removes all effect paint; 100% gives the strongest tint, halo or luminous band. Overall opacity still applies. With motion off or reduced motion active, the tint, halo and bands remain visible and still.</p>
          <label class="no-check"><input type="checkbox" data-no-field="motion" checked /><span>Allow gentle effect motion</span></label>
          <p class="no-hint" data-no-motion-status>Reduced-motion preferences are respected. Motion stops when this page is hidden.</p>
        </fieldset>
      </form>
      <aside class="no-companion" aria-label="Scope, privacy and Windows download">
        <section><h2>For other Windows apps</h2><p>The separate desktop utility can show a click-through overlay above ordinary Windows apps. The website settings do not control it.</p><a class="no-download" href="/downloads/name-overlay/Ajew-Name-Overlay-Windows.zip" download>Download Windows ZIP</a><p class="no-hint">Unzip and follow the included instructions. No administrator access or startup registration is needed. Secure desktop and exclusive full-screen apps may not show the overlay.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Your choice, your browser</h2><p>No analytics, account or uploads are used by this feature. It requests only ajew.org’s own glyph asset. Saved preferences stay in this browser’s local storage; Clear removes them and turns the overlay off.</p><p>The Name is sacred. Use the display thoughtfully, and hide it whenever appropriate.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Reading &amp; letter source</h2><p><a href="/reader/shivchay-haran/1/2/">Shivchay HaRan, section 2</a> describes Rabbi Nachman’s effort to keep the Divine Name before his eyes. This link is background for the reminder, not a source claim for either combined arrangement or the user-supplied footer.</p><p class="no-hint">The primary Name outlines use Stam Ashkenaz CLM; the pointed footer uses shaped Keter YG outlines for complete vowel marks. Both fonts have a GPLv2 license with a font embedding exception. <a href="/name-overlay/copyright">Font copyright &amp; exception</a> · <a href="/name-overlay/GNU-GPL">License</a> · <a href="/name-overlay/FONT-PROVENANCE.json">Asset provenance</a>.</p></section>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
